1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,740
King Midas did a kindness for a

2
00:00:02,740 --> 00:00:04,680
companion of Dionysus.

3
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:07,660
In return, the god offered him a

4
00:00:07,660 --> 00:00:10,840
reward. Midas chose the power to turn

5
00:00:10,840 --> 00:00:12,740
